Package: corei-os
Version: @VERSION@
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: COREI OS <noreply@coreeyegroup.github.io>
Depends: python3.12, adduser, postgresql-client
Recommends: corei-os-server
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Homepage: https://github.com/coreeyegroup/corei-os
Description: COREI OS institutional intelligence and execution platform
 Operator API, outbox relay and ledger consumer for COREI OS, with the
 corei-os command for migrations, backups, status and profiles.
 .
 Live trading is disabled in this build. Install corei-os-server for a
 complete single-machine setup with PostgreSQL and Kafka.
